  "description": "Chatham Rev 3 was made for effortless fun in the sun: Ride in total comfort with the padded saddle, non-slip grips and pedals, and sweptback handlebars that support a comfortable, upright riding position. Choose your boost with the customized complete Ananda e-system that controls the Pedal Assist, headlight, and more. You’ll cover more ground with a range of up to 42 miles and top speed of 20mph, and don’t sweat any bumps and cracks on the pavement – extra-wide 3” tires and Tektro mechanical disc brakes with added vibration resistance will guarantee a smooth-rolling ride. Plus, with more customization options than other ebikes, you can tailor your ride to fit your adventures by adding a basket, rear rack, fenders, and more (sold separately). This ebike is also equipped with an integrated 40Lux headlight and battery-operated taillight, so you can enjoy shoreside sunsets without worrying about getting back before dark.",
